FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: a-hunger-artist.
FILED BY: the impresario, on behalf of the artist, who did not ask.

OFF THE RECORD: The artist fasts publicly. Admirers may attend (serve
OFF THE RECORD: a word of appreciation upon the case); the artist
OFF THE RECORD: waits one court day for each of them, and no longer.
OFF THE RECORD: The fast ends when a day passes and nobody comes,
OFF THE RECORD: which is how these things end.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT day IS 0.

ARTICLE 2.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT day IS day PLUS 1.
    AWAIT SUMMONS FOR AT MOST 1 DAY, FILED UNDER admirer. FAILING WHICH, REFER TO ARTICLE 3.
    PROCLAIM "day " PLUS (THE TRANSCRIPT OF day) PLUS ": an admirer remarks, " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF admirer.
    REFER TO ARTICLE 2.

ARTICLE 3.
    PROCLAIM "day " PLUS (THE TRANSCRIPT OF day) PLUS ": nobody came. The fast is concluded and the cage is swept out.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
